1. MODEL ARCHITECTURE
---------------------------------------------------------------------
- Visual Branch: EfficientNet-B0 (Pretrained on ImageNet)
- Text Branch: BERT-base-uncased (Pretrained on Wikipedia/BooksCorpus)
- Fusion Head: Concatenated 2048 features -> 512 -> 256 -> 128 -> 4 classes

